## Why This Is Asked
Tests end-to-end orchestration, privacy controls, and cross-account access at scale for regulated financial data.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven architecture with S3, Textract, and SageMaker
- Data redaction and normalization using ML models
- Data governance: encryption, IAM least privilege, access logs, retention
- Cross-account auditing via Resource Access Manager and KMS key sharing

## Code Example
```javascript
